other who lives in a town by the sea, and a new adventure begins. A Peaceful, Cozy Adventure GameThe story progresses through conversations with the villagers and errands.There is no combat or intense action in this game. Please enjoy it in a relaxed atmosphere. A Little MysteryAs you progress through the game, there are a few mysteries that call forth more mysteries. (Exaggerated?)What is the secret behind his father's death? A cursed forest?A secret underground facility?Calm Background MusicThe game features music by four composers: Tomás Palazzi, Svyatoslav Petrov, Josh Kashdan and Kyle Booth. All of the music was written exclusively for this game. Please play the demo version and listen to the music for yourself. All of the tracks are gentle and wonderful, and you'll want to listen to them over and over again. Unique Characters and AnimalsThe main character, Brass, is a 14-year-old boy who has started working at the post office to help support his family. You'll also meet many other characters. SceneryThe story takes place in a mountain village and a seaside town. Brass runs around in the cute isometric-ish sceneries."}